2. The game — all rights reserved
---------------------------------

Copyright (c) 2026 E. Halsey Miles. All rights reserved.

This covers everything in this repository outside `tools/`, including but not
limited to: the game design, rules and rulebook; the map, tiles, and tile set;
company, private, and train rosters; the world, its regions, names, and
fiction; all artwork; the generated components in `print/`; the 18xxMaker game
file `18dragon.json`; the documentation in `docs/`; and the design and planning
artifacts in `_artifacts/`.

You may read this material, clone this repository, and print and play the game
for your own personal, non-commercial use, including playtesting it with your
own group.

You may not redistribute this material, publish derivative works based on it,
or use it commercially, without the prior written permission of the copyright
