Third-party note
----------------

18Dragon is a variant of *1822*, designed by Simon Cutforth and published by
All-Aboard Games. 18Dragon is an independent, unofficial work and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by them. Base 1822's rules are described here
only to the extent needed to state how 18Dragon differs; no 1822 rulebook text
is reproduced in this repository.
